# Shared types hub

Primitivos y entidades compartidas **no** viven en `features/auth/types`.

## Dónde va cada tipo

| Tipo | Ubicación |
| --- | --- |
| `EntityId`, `IsoDateTimeString`, `StellarAddress` | `src/types/primitives.ts` |
| `AccountRole`, `WithAccountRoles`, `WithEntityTimestamps` | `src/types/roles.ts` |
| `UserResponse`, `UserProfileFields` | `src/types/user.entity.ts` |
| `Sep10Challenge`, session challenge unions | `src/types/sep10.entity.ts` |
| Session/register/request auth-only | `features/auth/types/auth.types.ts` |
| Dominio de feature (org, api-key, wallet) | `features/[feature]/types/` |

Barrel: importar desde `@/types` (ver [`src/types/index.ts`](src/types/index.ts)).

## Prohibido

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — hub oculto en auth
import type { UserResponse, EntityId } from "@/features/auth/types/auth.types";

// ✅ GOOD
import type { UserResponse, EntityId } from "@/types";
```

- **No** añadir tipos cross-feature a `auth.types.ts`
- `auth.types.ts` solo re-exporta lo compartido por compatibilidad interna de auth; **nuevos** consumidores usan `@/types`
- Antes de crear un tipo: buscar en `src/types/` y `features/*/types/`
